type: software
title: "Africa Data Atlas & Cartographic Observatory"
abstract: >-
  An independent research platform combining interactive cartography, a curated
  2015-2024 indicator snapshot for 54 African states, summary statistics from the
  SlaveVoyages trans-Atlantic database (1514-1866), and ethnic-group cartography.
